lActivity><witsml:comments>LD lubricator and RD sheave wheels. Split lubricator at drill floor, preserved and moved to cantiliver. Cleared rig floor of WL equipment.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-17T04:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-17T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed 10 mT lift cap on WL riser and installed manual elevator on riser section as part of double lift arrangement from TDS. Detached riser from BOP&apos;s and LO same.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-17T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-17T10:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lifted WL BOP&apos;s using double lift arrangement from TDS and transferred to moonpool overhead crane.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-17T10:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-17T11:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Disconnected and lifted out lower WL riser section and XO from XMT using double lift arrangement from TDS. Installed hatch on weather deck.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-17T11:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-17T11:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed XMT tree cap. Hooked up hose from Seawell test pump on drill floor to test cap on XMT.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-17T11:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-17T12:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Leak tested SV to 30/345 bar for 5/10 min. Good test. Bled off pressure to closed drain.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-17T12:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-17T13:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RD cmt test line and bleed off manifold from KWV.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-17T13:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-17T14:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Leak tested tree cap and XMT cross to 30/345 bar for 5/10 min using Seawell test pump and 100% MEG. Good test. Bled off pressure. Installed cap on KWV and removed 1/2&quot; plug. Leak tested KWV to 30/345 bar for 5/10 min using Seawell test pump and 100% MEG. Good test. Bled off pressure. Installed 1/2&quot; plug in KWV cap. Leak tested KWV cap to 30/345 bar for 5/10 min using Seawell test pump and 100% MEG. Good test. Bled off pressure. 

Disconnected Seawell test pump from XMT tree cap and closed needle valve. Disconnected local control panel for HMV and DHSV and re-established platform permanent control system.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-17T14:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-17T15:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Handed well over from Volve D&amp;W to Mærsk Production.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-17T15:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-17T16:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Cleared rig floor off remaining WL equipment. Cleaned rigfloor with dedicated grease wash.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
